{"1689640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warden's Will", "steam_appid": 1689640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3844460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/022d5b7622a1d7106edbace3dfbb6eae.avif?t=1756244986\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras_big/022d5b7622a1d7106edbace3dfbb6eae.avif?t=1756244986 width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wardens Will is a fast-paced, movement-focused rogue-lite shooter you can play solo or with up to 3 friends. Choose your Warden, experiment with different builds, and dive into chaotic arenas filled with unpredictable robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Movement and Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Warden offers different ways to move and fight  dash, hover, slash, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment with a Variety of Weapons and Augments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your gear and builds to find combos that fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate Diverse Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging battles across varied environments  from lava fields to mysterious caves and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn and Adapt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is tough, expect to die often, but each run teaches you how to improve and survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/d60580e144dffa4eb33cbfd0bdacd540.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or Team Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the challenge on your own or cooperate with friends to overcome waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/660fc18c0c5b49a832282637a44047fe.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s see what you’ve got.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/022d5b7622a1d7106edbace3dfbb6eae.avif?t=1756244986\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras_big/022d5b7622a1d7106edbace3dfbb6eae.avif?t=1756244986 width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wardens Will is a fast-paced, movement-focused rogue-lite shooter you can play solo or with up to 3 friends. Choose your Warden, experiment with different builds, and dive into chaotic arenas filled with unpredictable robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Movement and Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Warden offers different ways to move and fight  dash, hover, slash, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/28724718eb41075f0bacc201a9e61e8b.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment with a Variety of Weapons and Augments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your gear and builds to find combos that fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.webm?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/48879cd0054747784880056f19ea503c.mp4?t=1756244986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate Diverse Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging battles across varied environments  from lava fields to mysterious caves and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1689640/extras/eefb3c3d80559958ff6a11b580828a9f.poster.avif?t=1756244986\" wid